cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Remittances API + MCP
message: >-
  If you use this software or the data it serves, please cite both this
  repository and the US-Mexico Remittances Dashboard.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Juan Pablo
    family-names: Pietrini Sánchez
    email: jpietrin@stanford.edu
    affiliation: Stanford University
repository-code: https://github.com/jp-pietrini/remittances-api-mcp
url: https://remittances.mx/dashboard/api
abstract: >-
  Open REST API and Model Context Protocol server for remittance flows between
  the United States and Mexico. Serves quarterly Banco de Mexico data for 32
  Mexican states and 2,488 municipalities, plus US states of origin and the
  Mexican-born population behind the flows.
keywords:
  - remittances
  - Mexico
  - migration
  - open data
  - model context protocol
license: MIT
references:
  - type: database
    title: US-Mexico Remittances Dashboard
    authors:
      - given-names: Juan Pablo
        family-names: Pietrini Sánchez
    url: https://remittances.mx
